@startuml
skinparam handwritten false
actor User
participant "Voice Command" as Voice
participant "VisionAid App" as App
participant "Camera/AI" as AI
participant "TTS/Haptic" as Feedback

User -> Voice: Speaks command
Voice -> App: Intent (Explore/Find/OCR)
App -> AI: Process frame
AI -> App: Detected Object/Text
App -> Feedback: Speak result / Vibrate
Feedback -> User: Audio/Tactile Feedback
@enduml
